Error ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ variance.js:43:15

Cannot call `f` with `n` bound to `x` because in array element: `Readonly<[n: number]>` [1] is not exactly the same as
`[number]` [2]. [incompatible-type]

The above-mentioned two types must be the same because arrays are invariantly typed. To fix the error,
- Either make `Array<Readonly<[n: number]>>` [3] and `Array<[number]>` [4] exactly the same
- Or make `Array<[number]>` [4] a `ReadonlyArray`.
